    "APP_VIEW_CHOICE_DETAIL_STRING" : [
      {
        "target" : "Greife auf deine Apps zu, indem du auf die Digital Crown drückst. Du kannst die App-Darstellung jederzeit in den Einstellungen ändern.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "de"
      },
      {
        "target" : "היישומים שלך יופיעו עם לחיצה על ה-Digital Crown. אפשר לשנות את תצוגת היישומים בכל שלב דרך ״הגדרות״.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "he"
      },
      {
        "target" : "يمكنك الوصول إلى تطبيقاتك بالضغط على مفتاح Digital Crown. ويمكنك تغيير عرض التطبيقات في أي وقت من الإعدادات.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "ar"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Προσπελάστε τις εφαρμογές σας πιέζοντας το Digital Crown. Μπορείτε να αλλάξετε την προβολή εφαρμογών ανά πάσα στιγμή στις Ρυθμίσεις.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "el"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Digital Crownを押してAppにアクセスします。Appの表示は“設定”でいつでも変更できます。",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "ja"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Access your apps by pressing the Digital Crown. You can change the app view at any time in Settings.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "en"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Отримуйте доступ до програм, натиснувши Digital Crown. Подання програм можна змінити будь-якої миті в Параметрах.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "uk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Presiona la Digital Crown para acceder a tus apps. Puedes cambiar la visualización de apps desde Configuración.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "es_419"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Aceda às suas aplicações ao carregar na Digital Crown. O modo de visualização das aplicações pode ser alterado nas Definições.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "pt_PT"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Accede a tus apps pulsando la corona Digital Crown. Puedes cambiar la visualización de las apps en Ajustes en cualquier momento.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "es"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Få adgang til dine apps ved at trykke på Digital Crown. Du kan altid ændre appoversigten i Indstillinger.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "da"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Accedi alle app premendo la Digital Crown. Puoi modificare la visualizzazione delle app in qualsiasi momento in Impostazioni.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "it"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Zoznam apiek otvoríte stlačením korunky Digital Crown. Zobrazenie apiek môžete kedykoľvek zmeniť v Nastaveniach.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "sk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "按下数码表冠访问App。您可以随时在“设置”中更改App视图。",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "zh_CN"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Pressione a Digital Crown para acessar os apps. Você pode alterar a visualização de apps a qualquer momento nos Ajustes.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "pt_BR"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Akses app anda dengan menekan Digital Crown. Anda boleh menukar paparan app pada bila-bila masa dalam Seting.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "ms"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Du kommer åt apparna genom att trycka på Digital Crown. Du kan när som helst ändra hur apparna visas i Inställningar.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "sv"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Access your apps by pressing the Digital Crown. You can change the app view anytime in Settings.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "en_AU"
      },
      {
        "target" : "K aplikacím přejdete stisknutím korunky Digital Crown. Zobrazení aplikací můžete kdykoli změnit v Nastavení.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "cs"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Digital Crown을 눌러서 앱에 접근합니다. 앱 보기는 설정에서 언제든지 변경할 수 있습니다.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "ko"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Se appene dine ved å trykke på Digital Crown. Du kan endre appvisningen når som helst i Innstillinger.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "no"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Az appokhoz való hozzáféréshez nyomja meg a Digital Crownt. Az appnézetet bármikor módosíthatja a Beállításokban.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "hu"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Digital Crown’a basarak uygulamalarınıza erişin. Uygulama görüntüsünü istediğiniz zaman Ayarlar’da değiştirebilirsiniz.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "tr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Zainstalowane aplikacje będą wyświetlane po naciśnięciu Digital Crown. Możesz to zmienić w dowolnej chwili w Ustawieniach.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "pl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Accédez à vos apps en appuyant sur la Digital Crown. Vous pouvez modifier la disposition des apps à tout moment dans Réglages.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "fr_CA"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Truy cập các ứng dụng của bạn bằng cách nhấn Digital Crown. Bạn có thể thay đổi tùy chọn xem ứng dụng bất kỳ lúc nào trong Cài đặt.",
        "filename" : "CompanionAppViewSetup.strings",
        "language" : "vi"
